-- statement:
--   **The kernel pass represents the kernel** (25) of `A` on selected bit `i`.
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.KFHKer`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem NLogN.KFH.ker_rep (hρ : ρ < K) (i : Fin D) {M : M2G} {A : Butterfly.M2} {e : ℕ} (hA : KerOk M A e)
--       {r F : ℕ} {zs : List GI} {xs : List (Fin r → ℂ)} (hx : RecRep r F zs xs)
